  "title": "Easy Chicken Stuffed Manicotti",
  "description": "Chicken tenders seasoned and stuffed into manicotti shells, smothered in Alfredo sauce and Parmesan cheese, and baked until bubbly. Easy and delicious!",
  "authors": [
    "Jessica P"
  ],
